<LegalLayout title="Terms of use" description="The terms for buying fabrics, requesting upholstery services, booking consultations and joining virtual classes with Yucca Homeware." active="terms" draftNote="These draft terms should be reviewed for your business and applicable local law before launch. Add your cancellation and rescheduling policy for virtual classes.">
  <p>Product descriptions, availability and pricing are provided as accurately as possible and may be updated. Placing an order submits a purchase request; orders are confirmed after review and payment arrangements. Fabric is sold by the unit displayed on each product listing.</p>
  <h2>Orders and services</h2>
  <p>Delivery timing, service scope and quotations are confirmed with each customer. A consultation request is not confirmed until Yucca Homeware contacts you. Please ensure delivery and project details are accurate.</p>
  <h2>Virtual classes and training</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Sessions are booked by the hour, with a minimum of one hour. Additional time is charged at the applicable hourly rate.</li>
    <li>Payment is required before the session. A booking is confirmed once payment is received.</li>
    <li>Sessions take place online via Google Meet, Zoom or WhatsApp video. You are responsible for a working device and internet connection.</li>
    <li>Group training is quoted separately.</li>
    <li>To reschedule, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a> as early as possible before your session.</li>
  </ul>
